00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.030
But we have another example and it's Texas
instruments. They make those, remember those

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:17.260
graphing calculators from high school and
college that you could sometimes install tetracycline

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:22.070
and instead of doing differential equations,
you were actually playing tetris much to the,

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:27.110
uh, um, uh, ignorance of the professor, which
