00:00:35.469 --> 00:00:43.449
spent five point $1 billion repurchasing shares
of their own stock that is twice the amount

00:00:43.449 --> 00:00:48.850
that they spent the year before and more than
any other Texas company in the s and p 500

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:53.200
index. It just so happens that under Trump's
tax plan, their tax rate, their effective

00:00:53.200 --> 00:01:02.489
