2018 overall companies in the s and p 500

00:01:02.489 --> 00:01:08.110
saw an effective tax rate decrease of seven
percentage points on average and tons of those

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:12.829
companies are using that extra money simply
to pump up the price of their own stock by

00:01:12.829 --> 00:01:17.700
repurchasing shares, which benefits, as I've
told you before, their shareholders and their

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:22.460
executives, the richer they are, the more
they benefit from pumping their own stock.

00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:27.700
Texas Instruments wrote in their 10 k filing
that quote. Our strategy is to return all

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:33.360
free cashflow to shareholders which is in
